WEBVTT

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:02.500
This is a bonus! See you again!

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:32.380
It's the original of this shop.

00:02:32.380 --> 00:02:33.330
Hmm...

00:02:33.330 --> 00:02:36.330
You know this kind of shop a lot, don't you, Noa?

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:37.330
Team?

00:02:37.330 --> 00:02:38.910
Team?

00:02:38.910 --> 00:02:44.470
Huh?

00:02:44.470 --> 00:02:47.280
It's late at night.

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:51.620
What's wrong?

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:30.590
This?

00:03:30.590 --> 00:03:31.500
I see...

00:03:31.500 --> 00:03:32.940
Oh?

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:33.780
Eh?

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:42.070
Why are there civilians here?

00:04:43.070 --> 00:04:44.880
Leave me to us and run away!

00:05:02.490 --> 00:05:04.570
Do you think you can stop it?

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:06.860
Open the way to the castle quietly!

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:08.860
If you do that, there will be no harm!

00:05:08.860 --> 00:05:13.120
Hmm...

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:14.280
It's a reasonable thing.

00:05:14.280 --> 00:05:15.360
Well, it's okay.

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:17.280
Then I'll just kick it.

00:05:17.280 --> 00:05:18.050
I'll do it!

00:05:21.600 --> 00:05:28.420
Please, Fritz!

00:05:49.740 --> 00:05:52.790
I don't want you to forget.

00:06:12.060 --> 00:06:25.500
I can't help but think that there was something like Zornflare.

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:28.440
Okay, let's fly quietly on this field.

00:06:28.440 --> 00:06:29.730
But...

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:31.500
You can't do this next time!

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:34.790
Shut up!

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:37.240
There's no need to wait until next time!

00:06:37.240 --> 00:06:38.940
Daigaku!

00:06:38.940 --> 00:06:49.430
Ah! Wait a minute!

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:50.540
Please stop!

00:06:50.540 --> 00:06:52.690
Hey, what are you doing?

00:06:52.690 --> 00:06:58.760
Anyway, please listen to the situation here.

00:07:09.340 --> 00:07:15.030
I heard from the soldiers that you are the one who killed the dragons, right?

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:16.650
That's right.

00:07:16.650 --> 00:07:18.820
I heard that there were two of you.

00:07:18.820 --> 00:07:21.930
Don't worry about the other side.

00:07:21.930 --> 00:07:23.930
This happens often.

00:07:23.930 --> 00:07:25.480
I see.

00:07:25.480 --> 00:07:28.670
Anyway, what's your name?

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:30.000
Rina. Rina Inoue.

00:07:30.060 --> 00:07:30.860
It's an inverse.

00:07:34.060 --> 00:07:35.430
You're that madman!

00:07:35.430 --> 00:07:37.540
Uh, no, I see.

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:40.740
Then you might be able to do something about it.

00:07:40.740 --> 00:07:45.550
I'm sorry, but over here.

00:07:45.550 --> 00:07:49.520
Look!

00:07:49.520 --> 00:07:50.370
There!

00:07:50.370 --> 00:07:51.190
That's...

00:08:20.440 --> 00:08:24.110
A thousand years ago, during the Kouma War,

00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:27.560
a demon tribe came to this land.

00:08:27.560 --> 00:08:30.000
The demon tribe was filled with death and fear.

00:08:30.190 --> 00:08:33.110
A single warrior challenged the battle.

00:08:33.110 --> 00:08:38.000
After the fierce battle, the warrior sealed the demon clan in this land.

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:47.480
The King of Time praised the child and gave the warrior the blood of a lord to protect this land.

00:08:47.480 --> 00:08:53.920
That was the beginning of my Calvard family.

00:08:53.920 --> 00:08:57.520
Well, that's all I have to brag about.

00:09:00.120 --> 00:09:02.120
You think I'm bragging about it?!

00:09:03.070 --> 00:09:03.570
That's right.

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:09.000
However, the reason why I'm causing such a ruckus in the Dragon Army today is because...

00:09:09.990 --> 00:09:12.360
...I have a daughter!

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:15.370
Destroy her!

00:09:16.370 --> 00:09:20.930
I see.

00:09:20.930 --> 00:09:21.980
You hired a magician.

00:09:22.980 --> 00:09:29.750
He may not be my enemy, but if that's how he comes to me, I'll be serious about it.

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:30.930
I'll give you a chance.

00:09:30.930 --> 00:09:31.770
Come here!

00:09:31.770 --> 00:09:32.720
I'm gonna kill you!

00:09:32.720 --> 00:09:40.150
Black Knight, Son Fort.

00:09:40.150 --> 00:09:42.120
Here.

00:09:42.120 --> 00:09:44.820
I'm preventing you from using your Gaisu.

00:09:45.600 --> 00:09:48.140
It's time for you to show your power.

00:09:48.140 --> 00:09:51.390
With that power, bring me victory!

00:09:51.390 --> 00:09:54.030
Everything is for Marene.

00:09:58.320 --> 00:10:00.000
When did you come? What are you doing?

00:10:05.530 --> 00:10:30.000
The shadow of the witch at that time? What did you come to do? I don't know. I don't know what to do! Wait, Sonfort! My sword is not there! That's right!

00:10:35.340 --> 00:10:37.190
It's not just a normal thing to see, is it?

00:10:37.190 --> 00:10:39.880
How about putting your strength into this story?

00:10:39.880 --> 00:10:42.490
You can take it to the emperor right now.

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:47.130
Such a script...

00:10:47.130 --> 00:10:49.340
Don't put out the diary as it is.

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:58.150
It can't be helped if you say that much.

00:10:58.150 --> 00:11:00.000
All right, I'll lend you my hand.

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:04.580
But why are you fighting in the middle of the road?

00:11:04.580 --> 00:11:05.760
You don't know.

00:11:05.760 --> 00:11:09.070
Father, can you give me my allowance?

00:11:09.070 --> 00:11:11.620
Wait a minute!

00:11:11.620 --> 00:11:16.980
Are you guys having a big fight?

00:11:16.980 --> 00:11:23.320
The direct cause is the allowance, but the fundamental cause is something else.

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:24.340
What do you mean?

00:11:32.010 --> 00:11:40.140
That kid is also a rebel, after all.

00:11:40.140 --> 00:11:50.650
Marlene had the power to exchange hearts with the dragons.

00:11:50.650 --> 00:11:53.980
So she was planning on setting up the Dragon Knights,

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:57.410
but those dragons brought them all together.

00:11:57.410 --> 00:12:00.000
So, even if those dragons

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:03.170
I want you to bring Marene back without hurting her.

00:12:04.960 --> 00:12:11.270
Don't ignore it and go home!

00:12:11.270 --> 00:12:14.080
I can't go out with such a scabby parent-child quarrel!

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:15.970
Well, I'll do something about it.

00:12:15.970 --> 00:12:17.410
I refuse.

00:12:17.410 --> 00:12:19.360
200 gold coins.

00:12:19.360 --> 00:12:21.670
300.

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:26.420
But I can't do anything about it without hurting the dragon.

00:12:26.420 --> 00:12:27.980
Don't worry.

00:12:27.980 --> 00:12:30.000
Like my daughter, Marene, I...

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:33.240
I have the power to exchange my mind with the dragons!

00:12:33.240 --> 00:12:37.140
I'll go with you, and the dragons will manage somehow.

00:12:37.140 --> 00:12:40.700
However, Marene's hand is not limited to the dragons.

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:42.750
The hand of the swordsmen is also a part of it.

00:12:42.750 --> 00:12:46.200
Rather, I want you to do something about it.

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:50.130
Probably, Marene and the others will attack tomorrow morning as well, right?

00:12:50.130 --> 00:12:52.450
Tomorrow? Not now?

00:12:52.450 --> 00:12:53.200
Yes.

00:12:53.200 --> 00:12:59.960
Until now, they were attacking when they were bored after having their lunch and going to sleep.

00:13:00.320 --> 00:13:05.930
As expected, this time, even if I don't have the guts to come back now, I'm afraid I'll attack early.

00:13:31.850 --> 00:13:34.730
Marene! Marene!

00:13:34.730 --> 00:13:40.980
Marene!

00:13:40.980 --> 00:13:42.870
What's up? It's noisy.

00:13:42.870 --> 00:13:45.140
It's time to go out.

00:13:45.140 --> 00:13:47.140
Yes, I understand.

00:13:47.140 --> 00:14:00.000
It's time to use our power to help Marene!

00:14:00.600 --> 00:14:02.720
With all our power

00:14:02.720 --> 00:14:08.080
Go to the incomprehensible ruler and pay for it!

00:14:08.080 --> 00:14:17.170
Scream as you like

00:14:17.170 --> 00:14:21.730
Because we are the last to laugh

00:14:21.730 --> 00:14:27.640
What are you doing here?

00:14:27.640 --> 00:14:30.000
I wonder if I was walking in the corridor

00:14:30.190 --> 00:14:34.730
I heard a loud scream, so I had no choice but to meet him.

00:14:34.730 --> 00:14:36.790
Oh, I see.

00:14:36.790 --> 00:14:40.610
I'm sure the other party will take this new route.

00:14:40.610 --> 00:14:45.080
Originally, that fortress was my house's villa.

00:14:45.080 --> 00:14:51.390
But before I knew it, I was able to renovate it like that.

00:14:51.390 --> 00:14:55.310
Before I knew it, you would have noticed it if you had done that kind of construction.

00:14:55.310 --> 00:14:57.260
I didn't notice it.

00:14:57.260 --> 00:14:58.790
I see.

00:14:58.790 --> 00:14:59.890
I'm sorry.

00:15:00.440 --> 00:15:04.280
A group of dragons with the support team are advancing towards us.

00:15:04.280 --> 00:15:04.780
What?

00:15:04.780 --> 00:15:06.240
They're here, as I thought.

00:15:06.240 --> 00:15:08.520
It's faster than I thought, but...

00:15:08.520 --> 00:15:09.440
Mr. Rina!

00:15:09.440 --> 00:15:29.120
Oh, I didn't expect you to welcome me, Lord Calvert.

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:42.370
You're not going to fight with us with that much money, are you?

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:47.410
Or did you get Marlene's pocket money?

00:15:47.410 --> 00:15:48.640
Don't mess with me.

00:15:48.640 --> 00:15:51.320
I'm also a Calvert.

00:15:51.320 --> 00:15:56.630
I'm not ashamed of being threatened by my daughter and quietly giving her pocket money.

00:15:56.630 --> 00:16:00.000
Son Ford, let me stop you here today.

00:16:00.380 --> 00:16:01.740
Oh, that's interesting.

00:16:01.740 --> 00:16:07.600
I'd like to see how you can stop this dragon's movement.

00:16:07.600 --> 00:16:08.100
Hmph!

00:16:08.100 --> 00:16:11.930
Don't look down on me.

00:16:11.930 --> 00:16:15.590
I can connect my mind with the dragons.

00:16:15.590 --> 00:16:18.760
Did you think I couldn't do the same thing?

00:16:18.760 --> 00:16:20.700
N-no way...

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:21.920
Hmph!

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:47.730
Zorn Freya, listen to my heart's voice!

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:51.030
To my heart's voice!

00:17:05.820 --> 00:17:06.320
.

00:17:36.750 --> 00:17:42.830
I understand your feelings, but I simply failed to convince you.

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:45.080
That doesn't make any sense!

00:17:45.080 --> 00:17:48.250
In this case, I will beat up those dragons!

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:53.330
No, that won't happen! If you do that, I won't pay for your request!

00:17:53.330 --> 00:17:59.030
Drag slaves, we need to finish this quickly!

00:17:59.030 --> 00:18:00.000
I don't want any more chaban.

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:01.220
Is this the end?

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:08.040
Then, I will show you the power of the Black Knight, Son Fort, one by one.

00:18:08.350 --> 00:18:09.540
Isn't it interesting?

00:18:09.880 --> 00:18:12.390
Let me see your power.

00:18:12.880 --> 00:18:15.920
Your opponent is me.

00:18:15.920 --> 00:18:16.960
It's you.

00:18:16.960 --> 00:18:20.320
The magician that Marene-sama was talking about.

00:18:21.640 --> 00:18:26.440
I'm glad to be in front of this Dragon Corps, little girl.

00:18:26.880 --> 00:18:30.000
I'll ask for your name before the battle.

00:18:30.990 --> 00:18:34.000
I'm Rina, Rina Inverse.

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:51.800
Let's go, Rina Inverse!

00:18:51.800 --> 00:18:54.040
Get out of here, dragons!

00:19:04.670 --> 00:19:06.670
Oh, as expected of Rina-dono!

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:10.090
As expected? I haven't done anything yet, though.

00:19:10.090 --> 00:19:16.190
No, the dragons must have known Rina-dono's name, too.

00:19:16.190 --> 00:19:21.440
The five names of Rina-dono, who said that dragons also pass by.

00:19:21.440 --> 00:19:24.390
I didn't want the dragons to fight.

00:19:24.390 --> 00:19:27.270
That's why I'm so angry.

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:30.000
I don't know what it is, but...

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:32.000
This place is enough for me alone!

00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:34.000
Now, come from anywhere!

00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:34.820
Fireball!

00:19:34.820 --> 00:19:38.650
That's about it.

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:39.540
Nya!

00:19:39.540 --> 00:19:40.400
Not yet.

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:41.400
Eh?

00:19:41.400 --> 00:19:43.150
Ugh!

00:19:43.150 --> 00:19:47.020
Ugh!

00:19:47.020 --> 00:19:50.180
That's a boring kokeodoshi!

00:19:50.180 --> 00:19:51.180
Ugh!

00:19:51.180 --> 00:19:53.580
Ugh!

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:54.360
Ugh!

00:20:05.470 --> 00:20:08.710
This is the last warning from me.

00:20:08.710 --> 00:20:12.290
Promise me that you'll only save my life.

00:20:12.290 --> 00:20:17.340
If you do that, I don't mind if you stop fighting.

00:20:17.340 --> 00:20:20.620
I'm embarrassed, but you're going to surrender, aren't you?

00:20:20.620 --> 00:20:23.940
If you want to accept that, that's fine.

00:20:23.940 --> 00:20:26.450
I dare not deny it.

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:27.340
What are you going to do?

00:20:27.340 --> 00:20:28.590
What am I going to do?

00:20:28.590 --> 00:20:30.000
After all...

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:31.380
I'm going to kill you!

00:20:31.380 --> 00:20:33.590
What?

00:20:33.590 --> 00:20:40.690
You lost?

00:20:40.690 --> 00:20:49.910
Yes. The dragons have just returned, but the sound fort is nowhere to be seen. No matter how you think about it...

00:20:49.910 --> 00:20:51.870
What?

00:20:51.870 --> 00:20:53.850
Of course.

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:54.620
What did you say?

00:20:54.620 --> 00:20:58.520
Didn't I tell you? There's a Rina Inverse over there.

00:20:58.520 --> 00:20:59.730
No, I didn't hear you.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:01.520
I wonder if that's the case.

00:21:01.520 --> 00:21:04.240
Maybe it's that witch.

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:05.740
That's right.

00:21:05.740 --> 00:21:07.800
As long as Rina is over there,

00:21:07.800 --> 00:21:10.110
I can't win so easily.

00:21:10.110 --> 00:21:13.650
Then I'll fight with all my strength!

00:21:13.650 --> 00:21:15.660
Gaino!

00:21:15.660 --> 00:21:17.410
I left the loose to you.

00:21:17.410 --> 00:21:18.130
Yes.

00:21:18.130 --> 00:21:21.670
But I'll have you fight with me.

00:21:21.670 --> 00:21:25.020
I don't care.

00:21:25.020 --> 00:21:28.450
You guys!

00:21:28.450 --> 00:21:30.000
Now is the time to settle!

00:21:32.040 --> 00:21:33.460
and kill the enemy!

00:21:34.580 --> 00:21:38.460
The dragons are scared...

00:21:39.220 --> 00:21:42.500
You must have had a bad time with Rina after all.

00:21:42.500 --> 00:21:48.940
Damn it, I have to ask you to make sure that you don't kill my dragons!

00:21:48.940 --> 00:21:50.680
I won't give you snacks!

00:22:01.600 --> 00:22:07.840
Son Fort, why did you betray my daughter, even though you're the leader of this clan?

00:22:07.840 --> 00:22:10.590
I don't have time to tell you.

00:22:10.590 --> 00:22:16.220
A poor old man, a cute child, and the same salary.

00:22:16.220 --> 00:22:22.530
It's a natural duty for a man to follow his beautiful sister.

00:22:22.530 --> 00:22:24.530
Wow, you're so honest.

00:22:24.530 --> 00:22:30.000
I see, that's what it is.

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:31.400
I can't help it.

00:22:31.400 --> 00:22:33.310
I'm convinced of this.

00:22:33.310 --> 00:22:35.030
Well, by the way...

00:22:35.030 --> 00:22:39.730
You said you were the Mareneshi-Tenno, but...

00:22:39.730 --> 00:22:41.680
Who else do you have?

00:22:41.680 --> 00:22:46.960
If you promise me to resume my job as Captain Konoe,

00:22:46.960 --> 00:22:49.320
I don't mind if you tell me.

00:22:49.320 --> 00:22:52.050
Say it! Say it! Say it!

00:22:52.050 --> 00:22:54.770
Other than me...

00:22:54.770 --> 00:22:57.270
The first one is Gaizu's...

00:22:57.270 --> 00:22:58.680
What? That guy?

00:22:58.680 --> 00:22:59.800
You know him?

00:23:00.890 --> 00:23:04.690
I was supposed to be the prime minister until I got into trouble.

00:23:04.690 --> 00:23:10.950
But I've never heard of him being willing to go to war.

00:23:10.950 --> 00:23:13.070
Well, that's fine.

00:23:13.070 --> 00:23:14.850
So, what about the other members?

00:23:14.850 --> 00:23:17.750
With the permission of Lord Malene,

00:23:17.750 --> 00:23:22.920
I, Serpent Naga, became the 4th prince yesterday.

00:23:22.920 --> 00:23:24.160
What?

00:23:24.160 --> 00:23:25.670
Naga?

00:23:25.670 --> 00:23:26.620
What?

00:23:26.620 --> 00:23:27.750
Naga?

00:23:33.130 --> 00:23:34.190
You think so?

00:23:34.190 --> 00:23:35.670
Ah, no, it's fine.

00:23:35.670 --> 00:23:39.190
So, what about the other Shitenno?

00:23:39.190 --> 00:23:40.660
That's all of them.

00:23:40.660 --> 00:23:44.340
All of them are Shitenno, aren't they?

00:23:44.340 --> 00:23:46.160
You don't read well.

00:23:46.160 --> 00:23:53.410
Marene-sama made the name of Shitenno for the reason that the name is cool.

00:23:53.410 --> 00:23:56.080
The personnel is currently being recruited.

00:23:56.080 --> 00:23:57.500
Oh, really?

00:23:57.500 --> 00:24:00.000
It's not such a big deal.

00:24:00.280 --> 00:24:03.390
Wait a minute. If Naaga is with him, then...

00:24:03.390 --> 00:24:06.310
Calvato, let's shoot him out of here!

00:24:06.310 --> 00:24:08.390
Why are you suddenly...

00:24:08.390 --> 00:24:11.340
Since Naaga is with him, if he stays here,

00:24:11.340 --> 00:24:15.160
I'm afraid he'll blow up this castle with a single spell.

00:24:15.160 --> 00:24:17.240
Is that the kind of opponent you're talking about?

00:24:17.240 --> 00:24:18.180
That's the kind of opponent you're talking about.

00:24:18.180 --> 00:24:22.360
Oh, I see. Then I'll get the soldiers ready right away.

00:24:22.360 --> 00:24:26.210
All troops, charge!

00:24:58.480 --> 00:25:00.000
The time is different!

00:25:32.140 --> 00:25:35.320
If you don't have anything to eat, why don't you make some soup?

00:25:35.320 --> 00:25:41.440
Um, excuse me, I'm on leave now.

00:25:41.440 --> 00:25:43.380
Yes?

00:25:43.380 --> 00:25:50.930
No, I just took the soldiers and went out there, but I couldn't see you.

00:25:50.930 --> 00:25:51.770
Hmm?

00:25:51.770 --> 00:25:55.280
Then I got lost somewhere.

00:25:55.280 --> 00:25:58.000
What are you going to do with this?

00:25:58.000 --> 00:25:59.700
What should I do?

00:26:00.510 --> 00:26:06.450
It seems that after they left the base, they went somewhere else.

00:26:06.450 --> 00:26:08.050
I don't know.

00:26:08.050 --> 00:26:10.180
They came out in a hurry,

00:26:10.180 --> 00:26:16.110
but it seems that they were in a hurry at the same time.

00:26:16.110 --> 00:26:20.210
Well, you don't notice the number of Dragon Corps.

00:26:20.210 --> 00:26:22.670
