00:29:46.980 --> 00:29:48.920
Well, that's fine.

00:29:48.920 --> 00:29:52.760
Then that woman will be cleaned up by me and Mr. Naga.

00:29:52.760 --> 00:29:55.330
You guys hit the soldiers.

00:30:00.090 --> 00:30:04.040
Looks like you're going to fight again, Rina Inverse.

00:30:04.040 --> 00:30:06.400
It can't be helped.

00:30:06.400 --> 00:30:22.930
You finally realized how powerful I am, didn't you?

00:30:22.930 --> 00:30:25.380
