00:30:25.380 --> 00:30:30.000
What?

00:30:52.360 --> 00:30:55.000
It's the same for me!

00:31:20.410 --> 00:31:21.830
I don't know.

00:31:30.860 --> 00:31:31.670
above.

00:32:02.810 --> 00:32:03.910
It hurts.

00:33:32.040 --> 00:33:37.300
