00:34:32.270 --> 00:34:36.420
Let's go!

00:34:36.420 --> 00:34:38.130
Let's go!

00:35:06.720 --> 00:35:07.220
What?

00:36:01.340 --> 00:36:03.240
That won't work.

00:36:03.240 --> 00:36:04.980
What are you going to do?

00:36:04.980 --> 00:36:09.440
If you're going to surrender now, you can save your own life.

00:36:09.440 --> 00:36:12.920
Hehehe.

00:36:12.920 --> 00:36:14.920
