00:38:35.960 --> 00:38:39.470
To defeat the enemy, you need to be on your side first.

00:38:39.470 --> 00:38:42.600
To infiltrate into the enemy, you need to hide inside.

00:38:42.600 --> 00:38:46.450
My plan seems to have worked out well.

00:38:46.450 --> 00:38:50.390
In that case, Rina,

00:38:50.390 --> 00:38:52.590
I don't care if you're angry or not.

00:38:53.790 --> 00:38:55.670
Well then,

00:39:14.240 --> 00:39:16.240
