00:40:16.070 --> 00:40:18.850
That expression is as if you are...

00:40:18.850 --> 00:40:21.400
That's right.

00:40:21.400 --> 00:40:23.360
Do you remember?

00:40:23.360 --> 00:40:28.770
I was the one who suggested the establishment of the Dragon Knights.

00:40:28.770 --> 00:40:29.890
What do you mean?

00:40:30.120 --> 00:40:31.420
Don't you understand?

00:40:31.420 --> 00:40:35.330
It's just that we were just being used.

00:40:35.330 --> 00:40:36.740
What?

00:40:36.740 --> 00:40:39.890
