00:40:47.490 --> 00:40:51.640
Do you think that we, the Dragon Clan,

00:40:51.640 --> 00:40:54.750
who have strong power, are worthy of ruling the world?

00:40:54.750 --> 00:40:56.910
We, the Dragon Clan?

00:40:56.910 --> 00:40:57.680
I knew it!

00:40:57.680 --> 00:41:00.000
I'll show you.

00:41:00.540 --> 00:41:01.760
Let's go!

00:41:53.480 --> 00:42:00.000
So, I think it's possible that the Dragon's unit was established.

00:42:00.000 --> 00:42:01.620
and merge into the human world,

00:42:01.620 --> 00:42:03.760
and then abandon the world in the blink of an eye!

00:42:03.760 --> 00:42:05.860
The dragons will rule the world!

00:42:05.860 --> 00:42:09.990
That's such an easy plan to come up with, isn't it?

00:42:09.990 --> 00:42:14.830
Yeah, it seems like humans are a little smart.

00:42:14.830 --> 00:42:22.060
However, if we have to give up on this plan

00:42:22.060 --> 00:42:24.520
if we have to give up on this plan

00:42:24.520 --> 00:42:24.840
if we have to give up on this plan

00:42:24.840 --> 00:42:30.000
However, if we have to hurt the pride of the dragon tribe,

00:42:30.000 --> 00:42:32.950
I won't forgive you only!

