Pride?

00:42:37.480 --> 00:42:38.680
You are proud of me, aren't you?

00:42:38.680 --> 00:42:41.930
Pride and self-knowledge are inseparable, aren't they?

00:42:41.930 --> 00:42:44.170
Don't say that line.

00:42:44.170 --> 00:42:45.760
Well, anyway.

00:42:45.760 --> 00:42:49.480
It seems that you don't have to hold back your opponent.

00:42:49.480 --> 00:42:52.070
