00:42:52.070 --> 00:42:54.270
Even if you don't hold back,

00:42:54.270 --> 00:42:57.840
I'm not a man who can be defeated like a human being.

00:42:57.840 --> 00:43:00.000
Well, then.

00:43:00.120 --> 00:43:09.010
It's darker than twilight.

00:43:09.010 --> 00:43:12.190
