00:43:19.330 --> 00:43:23.510
The other party is starting to make a spell.

00:43:23.510 --> 00:43:25.880
It was born in the flow of time.

00:43:25.880 --> 00:43:28.600
A great man of men.

00:43:28.600 --> 00:43:29.530
It was born in the flow of time.

00:43:29.530 --> 00:43:30.000
It was born in the flow of time.

00:43:30.160 --> 00:43:33.340
I swear to the darkness here.

00:43:33.340 --> 00:43:37.930
Gah!

00:43:37.930 --> 00:43:42.370
We stand before you, and to all foolish ones,

00:43:42.370 --> 00:43:48.120
