00:51:45.160 --> 00:51:47.160
FREEZE PRIT!

00:51:48.180 --> 00:51:51.220
FREEZE!

00:51:52.220 --> 00:51:53.910
FREEZE PRIT!

00:51:53.910 --> 00:51:54.870
FREEZE PRIT!

