00:55:30.000 --> 00:55:33.060
You just have to raise the amount of money.

00:55:33.060 --> 00:55:34.260
That's right.

00:55:34.260 --> 00:55:37.110
It's better than getting a rebellion with a dragon.

00:55:37.110 --> 00:55:39.110
That's right.

00:55:39.110 --> 00:55:44.930
It's not enough to have 50 gold coins a month, so it's nonsense to raise it to 200.

00:55:44.930 --> 00:55:48.880
200 from 50 gold coins?

00:55:50.950 --> 00:55:57.740
